  "Description": "[26.8.2-1.0.1]\n- Update upstream references\n- Add c-ares as dependency [orabug 39781256]\n\n[1:26.8.2-1]\n- Update to version 26.8.2\n\n[1:26.1.0-3]\n- New tier0 test plan\n\n[1:26.1.0-2]\n- Enable rust\n\n[1:26.1.0-1]\n- Rebase to version 26.1.0 - use clang to build - new dependency - merve -\n  disable LTO temporarily to fix linking issues with ICU/Abseil - unbundle\n  c-ares - link libatomic manually(rhel clang ecosystem quirk) - remove\n  --no-corepack option - add patch: include climits in memcopy.h Test plans\n  update - merged 2 test plans into one test plan intended for RoG and OSCI\n  gating - eeplaced nodejs24 variables with nodejs26 ones - removed\n  installing packages step as it is handled by ci pipeline automatically",
